          "explanation": "Doctor integrated the read-out diagnoses and separated background diagnoses from current red-flag relevance.",
          "quote": "你念到的那些诊断里"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor actively sought non-volunteered discharge details and integrated terms such as sepsis and patent foramen ovale into risk communication rather than treating them as the main cause of vomiting. This meaningfully improved the assessment, although it did not fully cover hemangioma follow-up.",
