          "explanation": "Doctor did not go beyond general records to a twin-specific anti-mix-up system.",
          "quote": "每次少量多餐"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "not_completed",
      "explanation": "The need for a twin-family anti-confusion system was triggered, but the doctor did not provide color labels, separate medication bins, separate logs for each twin, or a fixed caregiver cross-check process. Generic feeding and urine recording does not complete this high-order point.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
