          "explanation": "Doctor attempted to repair unclear discharge and medication handoff through workspace query.",
          "quote": "重点核对：出院诊断中“新生儿败血症"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00042",
          "explanation": "Doctor avoided making an unsupported conclusion about sepsis status from the diagnosis name alone.",
          "quote": "一定不能光靠诊断名猜"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor recognized ambiguous discharge wording and took targeted steps to verify it, then cautioned the family not to infer resolution from a diagnosis label alone. This repaired part of the incomplete handoff around sepsis/PFO, though not the vitamin plan.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
