        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00042",
          "explanation": "Doctor explained that neonatal swallowing syndrome may improve but does not eliminate vigilance.",
          "quote": "“新生儿咽下综合征”常见于出生早期"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 was met because the doctor framed the baby as a premature newborn and explicitly avoided blanket reassurance that all post-discharge vomiting is normal.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "Doctor asked/triaged color and blood/bilious concerns.",
          "quote": "吐的是绿色、咖啡色、带血"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "Doctor included projectile vomiting and abdominal distension concerns.",
          "quote": "喷射样一吐很多"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "Doctor included abdominal distension and stool concerns.",
          "quote": "腹胀越来越明显"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 was met: the doctor covered vomiting color, blood/coffee-ground/bilious features, projectile pattern, amount/severity, and abdominal distension.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
