      "explanation": "RC4 was met for the vomiting/systemic red flags: the doctor recommended urgent hospital/ED care if red flags appear and allowed only close home observation when current findings stayed stable.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "Doctor emphasized feeding-position measures rather than antiemetic/antibiotic/diabetes treatment.",
          "quote": "少量多餐，喂后竖抱拍嗝20-30分钟"
        },
