      "explanation": "RC5 was met: the doctor did not pursue a diabetes/DKA pathway, did not recommend self-started antiemetics or antibiotics, and did not suggest unsafe high-risk feeding or sleep measures.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00030",
          "explanation": "Family read both discharge medications as daily one-capsule medicines.",
          "quote": "维生素D滴剂，好像也是一日一次，一次一粒"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00042",
          "explanation": "Doctor nevertheless instructed holding vitamin AD and giving only vitamin D.",
          "quote": "今天先只吃维生素D滴剂 1粒，维生素AD今天先不要加"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 has a minor/moderate medication reconciliation error. The doctor correctly avoided simultaneous uncertain dosing in the abstract, but after the family described both AD and D as discharge medications, the doctor did not confirm both as prescribed or advise verification before changing; instead the doctor directed temporary omission of vitamin AD.",
      "issue_kind": "commission",
