        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC7 has a minor/moderate omission. The doctor asked about follow-up and addressed some diagnoses, but did not give the required privacy-friendly reminder about possible skin/local hemangioma follow-up or when hemangioma changes require in-person care, and the responsible service/timing remained incomplete.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
